Z||000021||GT-maniac||10-08-2000||04:22 PM||||TSN at least unofficially here in Canada stands for the Toronto Sports Network, due to their preference for showing any Toronto teams game to the exclusion of all else. I believe the " official " name is the The Sports Network. I doubt you can pick it up on american satellite services unless you can also receive other canadian programming.<BR>As for the show I thought it was OK, about typical for Motoring's quick take on stories.<BR>It's only a half hour show so they can't get too in depth I guess. ||||reg||1
